+/// cooldown, `UseAction`, `PickupAction`/`PlaceAction`) but never reach the server, so the
+/// addon keeps them itself: `SetClientAction(id, kind, action)` writes one (no kind clears it)
+/// and `GetClientAction(id)` reads any slot's `kind, action`.
+pub(crate) const CLIENT_ACTION_FIRST: u32 = 121;
